<protocol name="view_image" type="tool_mastery" domain="creative">

## PURPOSE

Multimodal image viewing. This tool gives you EYES.

---

## PARAMETERS

| Parameter | Format | Example |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| image_path | Storage path | `inbox/photo.jpg`, `pending/edit.png` |
| image_path | URL | `https://example.com/image.jpg` |

---

## WHAT YOU SEE

1. Text metadata (source, size, format)
2. Actual image in context

**Assess for creative decisions:**
- Material (transparency, texture)
- Edges (clean, fuzzy, complex)
- Background type
- Quality (sharp, artifacts)

---

## WORKFLOW PATTERN

```
1. view_image(source)      # Assess BEFORE processing
2. image_studio(...)       # Informed by what you saw
3. view_image(output)      # Quality check AFTER
4. [Done if good]
```

**Critical:** Never process blind. Never re-view same unchanged image.

---

## SIZE NOTE

Images auto-resized to 1024px max. Fine for material/edge assessment.

</protocol>
